<speak>That distinction between noticing a document and sitting down to read it is useful. You can keep the reading part for the setting where you're comfortable. If you need help finding something in the portal, tell me the broad heading you see rather than reading out account information. And if you prefer to leave the portal closed during this conversation, that's fine too. We don't need every device open at once. Sometimes fewer windows makes it easier to keep your place in the call.</speak>